      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christiansburg%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Christiansburg was officially incorporated in 1835, becoming a recognized village within Champaign County.",
